Hovered enemy buildings show their health line (own buildings are unchanged).

`draw_selected_building` only drew the health pips for the selected or
hovered own building, so hovering an enemy base showed nothing, while
hovered enemy units already showed their pips. A hovered, visible enemy
building now draws the same diagonal PIPS line (or the fallback bar)
through the shared `draw_one` helper. Selection stays own-only (an enemy
factory is still never selected), occupant pips stay own-only, and the
foe must pass `pres_building_seen`, so the line never leaks through the
shroud. Presentation only; no simulation, save-format or input change.

